  "label": "Culinary Practice: Foil on Turkey",
  "description": "The use of foil on top of a roasted turkey is a common culinary practice to prevent the skin from burning and to retain moisture. This is a real-world cooking technique that is not inherently offensive. However, in the context of the meme, it is weaponized to perpetuate a harmful stereotype, making the background knowledge of this culinary practice essential to understanding the meme's intent.",
